{"title":"Lighthouse","slug":"Lighthouse","pageid":475,"revid":11317,"timestamp":"2024-03-20T18:56:00Z","lastEditor":"TheFlyFella","categories":["Locations","Stores"],"infobox":{"type":"Buildings","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay, Other Area 2"},{"label":"NPC","value":"David Chicken"},{"label":"Purpose","value":"Sells novelty and utility items"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.0.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"14/01/2023"},{"label":"Music","value":"[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6K3Axy5-_6A Kevin MacLeod - Cello Suite 1 In G - Prelude] (interior)"}]},"sections":[{"id":"inventory","text":"Inventory"},{"id":"secrets","text":"Secrets"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<p><br>\nThe Lighthouse is a building located near the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Oak_Depot/\">The Oak Depot</a>. It contains a shop run by <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/David_Chicken/\">David Chicken</a>. The shop contains certain novelty and utility items.\n</p><p><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Jerry's_Junk/\">Jerry's Junk</a> is outside, to the right of the building.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"inventory\">Inventory</h2>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Magic wand ub\">Magic wand ub</span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Magic_Anchor_Wand/\">Magic Anchor Wand</a></td>\n<td>$14,999\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Silly Quackers Vinyl\">Silly Quackers Vinyl</span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Silly_Quackers/\">Silly Quackers</a></td>\n<td>$600\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Northen Glade Vinyl\">Northen Glade Vinyl</span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Northern_Glade/\">Northern Glade</a></td>\n<td>$600\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span ty